            "text": "{\n  \"judgments\": [\n    {\n      \"proposal_id\": \"P0000\",\n      \"source_refs\": [\"F001:F004\"],\n      \"rationale\": \"Claim C0000 models the specific automatic dismissal rule of paragraph (1). The proposed edit rewrites C0000's summary to subsume paragraphs (2), (3), and (4), which are already captured in distinct claims (C0001 through C0004). Bundling these separate statutory rules into C0000 does not fix a defect, creates duplicate summaries, and obscures the discrete scope of paragraph (1).\",\n      \"verdict\": \"unsupported\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"proposal_id\": \"P0001\",\n      \"source_refs\": [\"F001:F004\"],\n      \"rationale\": \"In addition to inappropriately bundling paragraphs (2) through (4) into the summary of claim C0000, the proposal alters the modal force of paragraph (4). The source text in paragraph (4) states that 'the court may decline to dismiss the case', establishing a discretionary power, whereas the proposed summary incorrectly states that 'the court must decline dismissal'.\",\n      \"verdict\": \"unsupported\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
